From: Carlos Ciconato <354919267+CarlosCiconato@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 12:31:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Generic alert engine (pro-style) with 3 actions and
 alert output

8 alerts, each: sensor (GPPWM channel list), above/below a fixed limit
or an RPM curve, minimum time, minimum RPM to arm, and action: warn only,
safe mode (fuel cut above alertSafeModeRpm) or engine off. A tripped
alert stays latched, with the alert output on, until the next start.
Live data: active/latched masks and level. TunerStudio: Advanced > Alerts.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkhsyMr5ndz2MBCxuDZhPC
